| JudgeBench   | MMLU-Pro [Wang et al., 2024], LiveBench [White et al., 2024], LiveCodeBench [Jain et al., 2024]                                   | ×        | Sample-Level  |
| CriticBench  | GSM8K [Cobbe et al., 2021], CSQA [Talmor et al., 2019],<br>BIGBench [Srivastava et al., 2022], HumanEval [Chen et al., 2021], etc | ×        | Sample-Level  |
