### <span id="page-24-3"></span><span id="page-24-0"></span>A.8 Analysis of Other Evaluation Metrics

| Model                | F1-Score | First Error Acc. | Any Error Acc. |
|----------------------|----------|------------------|----------------|
| GPT-4-turbo-128k     | 40.76    | 57.04            | 69.17          |
| GPT-4o               | 30.85    | 36.89            | 50.89          |
